        "id": 2472005095,
        "content": "Wrangler only looks specifically inside the directory given, so even though HTML changes are captured, typescript ones aren't. Therefore it is extremely unreliable to get global `ts` changes for example. So I've deprecated the server in favor of wrangler and wrote an observer using esbuild API that watches and rebuilds based on file change.",
