        "id": 2653444921,
        "content": "We've recently changed this repo's `package.json` start command to use wrangler pages because of the referral tracker kv implementation. \r\n```json\r\n\"start\": \"wrangler pages dev --port 8080\"\r\n```\r\nThis killed the live reload feature, and https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/issues/4824 we have to pass in a directory after wrangler pages dev to hear changes from. However, passing in `./` wont work since it only reads inside the received directory (non-recursive).",
